 uses on developing and honing a range of skills in various comedic discipli
 nes including stand-up\, improv\, and sketch.\n\nOur philosophy in teaching
  comedy is understanding that training is essential. It's a craft similar a
 nd not unlike any dance\, theatre or vocal program. There's a foundation th
 at can be learned which will expedite one's success. Ongoing workshops are 
